timeline.body:
LGTM ... just wondering if it would be better in general to follow the pattern like
```java
boolean ok = false;
try {
    // ...
    ok = true;
} finally {
    if (!ok) {
        // cleanup
    }
}
```
which is a bit "cleaner" and avoids the throw-any-checked hack. I guess that would be a larger search-and-replace operation though...
